msgid "What a channel is for. The tables follow one per model by themselves; a page of the project's own follows one the project declares, and the project says who may join it - here, one per team, for its agents. While this page is open, the count below follows the team's queue: close or reopen one of its tickets in another window and watch it move. No reload, and nobody is notified: it keeps this page true, and tells no one anything."
